{"base":"96251f128e2d0f5f58f05d5064672b37474ef409","description":"Use FsStore and rename cid module\n\n- Replace MemStore with FsStore in serve::Server so imported\n  content is pinned for the server's lifetime\n- Use add_path_with_opts with ImportMode::TryReference to\n  reference files in-place instead of copying\n- Use permanent tags (.with_tag) instead of TempTags to prevent\n  GC from collecting content before it's served\n- Rename share::cid to share::cid_utils to avoid ambiguity with\n  the cid crate (both consumers already aliased it as cid_util)\n- Clean up temporary store directory on server shutdown\n\n\nStream hashing in compute_content_id\n\n- Use BufReader + io::copy instead of fs::read to avoid loading entire\n  file contents into memory\n- Matches streaming approach used in compute_blob_cid","oid":"704a56ef1fa1e96e1947b596be551fff2b8a1bca","type":"revision"}